  "pom_about_screen_footer_description": "一款用于整理你整个积木收藏的应用，由先进的零件识别技术驱动",
  "@pom_about_screen_footer_description": {},
  "pom_about_screen_footer_title": "Brickit 出品的 Pileometer",
  "@pom_about_screen_footer_title": {},
  "pom_about_screen_list_item_1": "这款应用总是准确知道你需要的零件在哪一袋，还有你有多少个",
  "@pom_about_screen_list_item_1": {},
  "pom_about_screen_list_item_2": "透明袋真的太方便了：一眼就能找到，轻松拿到手",
  "@pom_about_screen_list_item_2": {},
  "pom_about_screen_list_item_3": "你可以马上知道是否拥有足够零件来完成我们海量图纸中的任意一款设计",
  "@pom_about_screen_list_item_3": {},
  "pom_about_screen_list_item_4": "你可以快速检查自己的收藏是否能补全缺失的套装",
  "@pom_about_screen_list_item_4": {},
  "pom_about_screen_list_item_5": "你还可以将收藏导入流行搭建设计网站，看看自己喜欢的方案是否能搭得出来",
  "@pom_about_screen_list_item_5": {},
  "pom_about_screen_store_btn": "立即体验",
  "@pom_about_screen_store_btn": {},
  "pom_about_screen_text_1": "我们相信，每一堆装满积木的盒子都蕴藏着巨大的玩法、学习与创意潜力。但首先，它需要成为一份收藏——结构清晰、易于取用、令人熟悉的零件集合。",
  "@pom_about_screen_text_1": {},
  "pom_about_screen_text_2": "所以我们打造了这款专门应用——Pile[o]meter",
  "@pom_about_screen_text_2": {},
  "pom_about_screen_text_3": "Pile[o]meter 将先进的 Brickit 扫描器与海量搭建创意图纸和专属储存系统结合在一起。只需两步即可开始：",
  "@pom_about_screen_text_3": {},
  "pom_about_screen_text_4": "按批次扫描你的零件",
  "@pom_about_screen_text_4": {},
  "pom_about_screen_text_5": "将它们分装进编号袋",
  "@pom_about_screen_text_5": {},
  "pom_about_screen_text_6": "接下来，一切都变得轻而易举：",
  "@pom_about_screen_text_6": {},
  "pom_about_screen_title": "管理好每一个零件，搭出更大作品",
  "@pom_about_screen_title": {},
  "pom_bad_scan_btn_learn": "打开扫描提示",
  "@pom_bad_scan_btn_learn": {},
  "pom_bad_scan_btn_retake": "retake photo",
  "@pom_bad_scan_btn_retake": {},
  "pom_bad_scan_btn_scan": "proceed anyway",
  "@pom_bad_scan_btn_scan": {},
  "pom_bad_scan_text": "Pile[o]meter’s scanning technology relies heavily on a correctly taken photo. Check out our guide to improve your results.",
  "@pom_bad_scan_text": {},
  "pom_bad_scan_title": "The Photo Seems Off",
  "@pom_bad_scan_title": {},
  "pom_education_screen_done_btn": "关闭",
  "@pom_education_screen_done_btn": {},
  "pom_education_screen_next_step_btn": "下一步",
  "@pom_education_screen_next_step_btn": {},
  "pom_education_screen_step_1_text": "将零件平铺成单层，确保它们之间没有重叠。每次扫描的理想数量为150至250件。",
  "@pom_education_screen_step_1_text": {},
  "pom_education_screen_step_1_title": "1. 不得重叠",
  "@pom_education_screen_step_1_title": {},
  "pom_education_screen_step_2_text": "请确保每个部件的所有关键特征均朝上，以便应用程序能够准确识别。",
  "@pom_education_screen_step_2_text": {},
  "pom_education_screen_step_2_title": "2. 正面朝上的特点",
  "@pom_education_screen_step_2_title": {},
  "pom_education_screen_step_3_text": "请使用干净、明亮且足够大的背景。两张打印纸（8.5英寸×11英寸）效果极佳！",
  "@pom_education_screen_step_3_text": {},
  "pom_education_screen_step_3_title": "3. 纯净背景",
  "@pom_education_screen_step_3_title": {},
  "pom_education_screen_step_4_text": "请确保光线充足且均匀。区分相似的零件并不容易，良好的照明会起到关键作用。",
  "@pom_education_screen_step_4_text": {},
  "pom_education_screen_step_4_title": "4. 良好的照明",
  "@pom_education_screen_step_4_title": {},
  "pom_education_screen_step_5_text": "请从正上方拍摄照片。尽量靠近拍摄，使零件占据画面的大部分。",
  "@pom_education_screen_step_5_text": {},
  "pom_education_screen_step_5_title": "5. 正确角度",
  "@pom_education_screen_step_5_title": {},
  "pom_education_screen_step_6_text": "拍照时请保持手机稳定，以免照片模糊。图像越清晰，扫描精度就越高！",
  "@pom_education_screen_step_6_text": {},
  "pom_education_screen_step_6_title": "6. 稳拍",
  "@pom_education_screen_step_6_title": {},
  "pom_education_screen_title": "扫描指南",
  "@pom_education_screen_title": {},
  "pom_finder_back_btn": "返回",
